,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, May to June hit 186% of normal, then November to December fell to 45%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 56% and June to July at 118%. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 17272 at 53%.</p>"}
